# Credit Risk & Customer Segmentation for Home Equity Loans

## Project Overview
Predictive analysis on 5,960 home equity loan records to identify 
default risk and segment customers into risk categories using 
Machine Learning techniques.

## Business Problem
Mortgage lenders face significant financial losses due to loan 
defaults. This project helps identify high-risk borrowers before 
approving home equity loans — enabling smarter lending decisions 
and reducing financial risk.

## Dataset
- **Source:** HMEQ Dataset (Kaggle)
- **Records:** 5,960 home equity loans
- **Features:** 13 variables
- **Target Variable:** BAD (1 = Defaulted, 0 = Repaid)

## Technologies Used
- **Language:** Python 3
- **Libraries:** Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Scikit-learn
- **Environment:** Jupyter Notebook

## ML Techniques Applied
| Technique | Type | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Logistic Regression | Supervised | Default Probability |
| Decision Tree | Supervised | Risk Classification |
| K-Means Clustering | Unsupervised | Customer Segmentation |

